The pre-trained checkpoint `prior/reinvent.prior` is not included in
this source release. Obtain the appropriate model separately from the
official REINVENT 4 model archive. Verify its provenance, license,
version compatibility, and SHA-256 checksum before use.

All other code in this directory (in particular `app/` — the FastAPI wrapper,
sampler, and integration code) is original work by AI Pharma and is not part
of REINVENT 4.

