Modifications:
    Adapted files have been minimally edited to remove dependencies on the
    full REINVENT 4 package (logging facade, runmode plumbing, etc.) and to
    work as a standalone inference module. Original algorithms, model
    architecture, and tokenization logic are unchanged.
